  "ja": [
   "クアラルンプールの跨座式モノレール、スコミ SUTRA の 4 両編成の端の車を、Rapid KL の赤と白の塗装で、おもちゃの車台に載る大きさで起こした 3D モデル。車体だけを作り、軌道桁を抱える部分は縁で切った。寸法は写真から読んだ。"
  ],
  "en": [
   "3D model of the end car of a four-car Scomi SUTRA set on Kuala Lumpur's straddle-beam monorail, in the Rapid KL red-and-white livery, sized to sit on a toy chassis. Only the body is modelled; the skirts that hug the beam end at the rim. Dimensions were read from photographs."
  ]
 },
